le_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_name"}, "name": "file_name", "label": "file_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "file_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_extension"}, "name": "file_extension", "label": "file_extension", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "file_extension"}, {"widget": {"name": "overwrite"}, "name": "overwrite", "label": "overwrite", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "overwrite"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 2, "type": "easy saveText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy saveText"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [1, 3], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [305.25732421875, 557.0321655273438], "pos": [-332.3404235839844, 167.4034881591797], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3-pro-preview", "你是一个视频提示词专家，按照我的这个格式解析下这个视频。只写提示词。分别生成中英两个版本。\n\n\n0-2秒：初始构图与氛围建立 采用中景（Medium Shot）开场，主体呈现强烈的2.5D超写实动漫（Hyper-realistic Anime）风格。少女通过灵动的猫爪手势建立第一人称交互感。此时画面侧重于展现复杂的服装纹理与发丝物理模拟（Hair Physics），背景采用纯黑深空，营造出高精细度的CG大师作质感。\n\n2-5秒：线性推进与质感显现 镜头执行平稳的推进（Push-in）。随着距离拉近，光影重心转向皮肤的**次表面散射（SSS）效果，呈现出通透、柔和的肉感。三点式布光中的轮廓光（Rim Light）**勾勒出浅色发丝的边缘，将主体从黑暗中完美剥离，展现出电影级的空间深度。\n\n5-8秒：极近特写与视觉冲击 镜头最终锁定在面部特写（Close-up）。触发极浅景深（Shallow DoF），使角色耳后的饰品进入自然虚化状态。重点聚焦于深蓝色的**异色瞳（Piercing Eyes）与精致的睫毛细节。整体风格在这一阶段达到顶点，融合了柔焦（Soft Focus）**美学与工业级渲染的锐利度，极具视觉张力。\n\n风格关键词： * 视觉流派： 超写实动漫（Hyper-realistic Anime）、大师作（Masterpiece）。\n\n光影氛围： 轮廓光（Rim Light）、高对比度（High Contrast）、柔焦（Soft Focus）。", "这是一个5秒的视频", 0.6, 467869059, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "link": 61, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 57, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 1, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [359.0669860839844, 354.1718444824219], "pos": [-11.000782012939453, 362.4419250488281], "widgets_values": ["### 中文版本\n\n**0-5秒：初始构图与食材呈现**\n采用垂直俯拍（Top-down Shot）开场，画面中心是一个充满怀旧感的搪瓷碗。碗内铺陈着两颗边缘焦脆的煎蛋（Fried Eggs）、红色的火腿切片与翠绿的香菜，底部隐约可见宽面与红油。一只手持筷子入画，建立第一人称视角的沉浸感（POV），打破静态摆盘。\n\n**5-12秒：动态搅拌与酱汁裹覆**\n筷子开始大幅度提拉搅拌（Stirring and Lifting）。宽面（Wide Noodles）展现出极佳的劲道与物理下垂感。随着搅拌动作，底部的浓郁红油酱汁（Chili Oil）被翻起，迅速包裹住洁白的蛋白与金黄的蛋黄，食物表面呈现出诱人的油润高光（Specular Highlights），令人食欲大增。\n\n**12-18秒：均匀融合与视觉高潮**\n镜头保持跟随搅拌动作的微颤，增加真实感（Handheld Shake）。此时碗内食材已完全融合，呈现出统一的高饱和度红褐色调。重点聚焦于面条上挂满的酱汁细节，展现出极其诱人的美食特写（Food Porn），强调“拌面”过程的治愈与满足感。\n\n**风格关键词：**\n*   **视觉流派：** 美食摄影（Food Photography）、生活记录（Vlog style）、超写实（Hyper-realistic）。\n*   **光影氛围：** 自然光（Natural Light）、高饱和度（High Saturation）、油润质感（Glossy Texture）。\n\n---\n\n### English Version\n\n**0-5s: Initial Composition and Ingredient Presentation**\nStarts with a vertical Top-down Shot (Overhead Shot), centering on a vintage-style enamel bowl. The bowl contains two fried eggs with crispy edges, sliced red sausages, and fresh cilantro, sitting atop wide noodles and chili oil. A hand holding chopsticks enters the frame, establishing an immersive First-person POV, breaking the static arrangement.\n\n**5-12s: Dynamic Mixing and Sauce Coating**\nThe chopsticks begin a vigorous Stirring and Lifting motion. The Wide Noodles demonstrate realistic elasticity and physics. As the mixing intensifies, the rich red chili oil from the bottom is brought up, rapidly coating the white egg whites and golden yolks. The food surface exhibits appetizing Specular Highlights and a glossy sheen.\n\n**12-18s: Uniform Fusion and Visual Climax**\nThe camera maintains a slight Handheld Shake to enhance realism. The ingredients are now fully blended, presenting a unified, high-saturation reddish-brown tone. The focus locks on the sauce-drenched details of the noodles, showcasing an irresistible \"Food Porn\" aesthetic that emphasizes the satisfying and therapeutic nature of mixing noodles.\n\n**Style Keywords:**\n*   **Visual Genre:** Food Photography, Vlog Style, Hyper-realistic.\n*   **Lighting/Atmosphere:** Natural Light, High Saturation, Glossy Texture."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 3, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 4, "type": "ShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "groupNodes": {"视频信息": {"external": [[8, 0, "STRING"]], "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [210, 194.5454559326172], "pos": [-1050, 0], "widgets_values": ["这是一个10秒的视频"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "index": 0, "id": -1, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_con